 > link_elf: symbol osf1_wait4 undefined

In order to load the linux module, you need to load the osf1.ko module.
Linux/alpha is rather osf/1 compatable and there is a lot of overlap,
so the alpha linuxulator leverages a lot of the osf1 module's code.

